{"4534200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Incremental Retro Racing", "steam_appid": 4534200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn more and more stars by driving faster and faster in Incremental Retro Racing. Accumulate and unlock 70+ vehicles, upgrades, track generation options, and more. Includes unlimited tracks and customizable CRT filter for that old school retro feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/62465201dce3ba5b7c82072a99365dff.poster.avif?t=1786093749\" width=448 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/62465201dce3ba5b7c82072a99365dff.webm?t=1786093749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/62465201dce3ba5b7c82072a99365dff.mp4?t=1786093749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Incremental Retro Racing you accumulate an ever increasing amount of stars by racing in many ways. Driving top speed, beating the clock, taking over cars, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/e19739b2f1b0be3f90ec2f3053133f39.poster.avif?t=1786093749\" width=290 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/e19739b2f1b0be3f90ec2f3053133f39.webm?t=1786093749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/e19739b2f1b0be3f90ec2f3053133f39.mp4?t=1786093749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each race you can go into the shop and use stars to unlock new vehicles, upgrades, modifications to track generation, the way you earn stars, and more. Make <span class=\"bb_strike\">millions</span> bazillions! Try to unlock everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/ca8473c3c074126935f4a63009255332.poster.avif?t=1786093749\" width=290 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/ca8473c3c074126935f4a63009255332.webm?t=1786093749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/ca8473c3c074126935f4a63009255332.mp4?t=1786093749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start out slow and steady and as you accumulate more the game will get faster and weirder vehicles and options to modify track generation will appear. You want to drive narrow roads with a maximum of hills and curves? Or long straight 30-lane highways with no traffic? There are unlimited tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/645ae79dfee189d0d8ba1cad82999c8f.poster.avif?t=1786093749\" width=448 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/645ae79dfee189d0d8ba1cad82999c8f.webm?t=1786093749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/645ae79dfee189d0d8ba1cad82999c8f.mp4?t=1786093749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To add to the old school feel of the retro gameplay Incremental Retro Racing also includes a fully customizable CRT Filter. Turn your 4K screen into an old tube with static noise and lousy picture. Just don't hit the tv to remove the color tornado but tweak the options instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/83acd838d73028843aa2ec6e4b5f6320.poster.avif?t=1786093749\" width=1100 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/83acd838d73028843aa2ec6e4b5f6320.webm?t=1786093749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/83acd838d73028843aa2ec6e4b5f6320.mp4?t=1786093749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn more and more stars by driving faster and faster in Incremental Retro Racing. Accumulate and unlock 70+ vehicles, upgrades, track generation options, and more. Includes unlimited tracks and customizable CRT filter for that old school retro feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/62465201dce3ba5b7c82072a99365dff.poster.avif?t=1786093749\" width=448 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/62465201dce3ba5b7c82072a99365dff.webm?t=1786093749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/62465201dce3ba5b7c82072a99365dff.mp4?t=1786093749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Incremental Retro Racing you accumulate an ever increasing amount of stars by racing in many ways. Driving top speed, beating the clock, taking over cars, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/e19739b2f1b0be3f90ec2f3053133f39.poster.avif?t=1786093749\" width=290 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/e19739b2f1b0be3f90ec2f3053133f39.webm?t=1786093749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/e19739b2f1b0be3f90ec2f3053133f39.mp4?t=1786093749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each race you can go into the shop and use stars to unlock new vehicles, upgrades, modifications to track generation, the way you earn stars, and more. Make <span class=\"bb_strike\">millions</span> bazillions! Try to unlock everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/ca8473c3c074126935f4a63009255332.poster.avif?t=1786093749\" width=290 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/ca8473c3c074126935f4a63009255332.webm?t=1786093749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/ca8473c3c074126935f4a63009255332.mp4?t=1786093749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start out slow and steady and as you accumulate more the game will get faster and weirder vehicles and options to modify track generation will appear. You want to drive narrow roads with a maximum of hills and curves? Or long straight 30-lane highways with no traffic? There are unlimited tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/645ae79dfee189d0d8ba1cad82999c8f.poster.avif?t=1786093749\" width=448 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/645ae79dfee189d0d8ba1cad82999c8f.webm?t=1786093749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/645ae79dfee189d0d8ba1cad82999c8f.mp4?t=1786093749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To add to the old school feel of the retro gameplay Incremental Retro Racing also includes a fully customizable CRT Filter. Turn your 4K screen into an old tube with static noise and lousy picture. Just don't hit the tv to remove the color tornado but tweak the options instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/83acd838d73028843aa2ec6e4b5f6320.poster.avif?t=1786093749\" width=1100 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/83acd838d73028843aa2ec6e4b5f6320.webm?t=1786093749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/extras/83acd838d73028843aa2ec6e4b5f6320.mp4?t=1786093749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Earn more and more stars by driving faster and faster in Incremental Retro Racing. Accumulate and unlock 70+ vehicles, upgrades, track generation options, and more. Includes unlimited tracks and customizable CRT filter for that old school retro feel.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/79bf5780c7d8d3e42775a572e4ac34759e223177/header.jpg?t=1786093749", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/67760447c5469ab4b5e5c7949a3db2dc0c3ec352/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786093749", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4534200/67760447c5469ab4b5e5c7949a3db2dc0c3ec352/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786093749", "website": "https://www.baardmoeder.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-3770 (2012)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 670 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-7700K (2017)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ventura<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i7-9750H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon Pro 555X<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Macbook Pro 2019 or higher</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ventura<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i7-9750H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon Pro 555X<br></li><li><strong>Sto